WEBVTT

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:12.460
Iden: This is Iden Versio of the Imperial Raider **Corvus**, sending a general distress call to the Rebel Alliance. We surrender.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.500
Shriv: Contact the General. Now.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.880
Lando: So you thought it was a trap, but brought them onboard anyway?

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:31.160
Shriv: You're always telling me to take risks! Seemed like the most irresponsible thing I could do.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:33.380
Lando: That’a boy.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:46.060
Lando: Hello. I’m General Lando Calrissian. You must be the Imperial defectors I’ve heard so much about.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.980
Iden: General. We've already told your people everything we know.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.180
Lando: Let's take a walk.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:54.520
Iden: Okay...
